  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "CameraUBO is a service class designed to manage a WebGL Uniform Buffer Object (UBO) for efficient camera matrix sharing. It centralizes the view and projection matrices into a single GPU buffer, significantly reducing per-draw call overhead in rendering pipelines. The class initializes the buffer, binds it to a fixed point, and provides an update method to synchronize CPU-side matrix data to the GPU every frame."
  },
